# ============================================
# EasyFund API - Environment Variables
# ============================================
# All environment variables are now in the root .env file.
# This file is kept for documentation only.
# ============================================
# 
# To configure the API, edit:
#   D:\Personal Project\EasyFund\.env
#
# Required variables for the API:
#   MONGODB_URI, MONGODB_DB_NAME
#   ACCESS_TOKEN_SECRET, REFRESH_TOKEN_SECRET
#   STRIPE_SECRET_KEY, STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET
#   FRONTEND_URL
#
# Optional variables:
#   FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID, FIREBASE_CLIENT_EMAIL, FIREBASE_PRIVATE_KEY
#   EMAIL_PRIVATE_KEY, EMAIL_DOMAIN
#   ADMIN_EMAILS
# ============================================
